		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じゅんびが　できたようだな
やれるだけ　やってこーい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-12T03:48:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
